{
  "messages": [
    {
      "key": "gift_given",
      "text": "Take {gift_item}. I may not have a trade, but I know how to say thanks.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_given",
      "text": "Here, {gift_item}. Maybe one of us will find the perfect use for it.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.liked",
      "text": "Good, {gift_item} worked. See? I can be useful without a workstation.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.liked",
      "text": "{tested_villager} liked it? Excellent. I am putting that under possible talents.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "Ah. Then my career in advice pauses here. Try {alternative_gift} for {gift_subject}.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "{gift_item} was wrong? Let us call it research. {alternative_gift} should work better.",
      "weight": 22
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "This is why nobody pays me for advice. Try {alternative_gift}.",
      "dispositions": [
        "cautious",
        "rude",
        "hostile",
        "fearful"
      ],
      "weight": 20
    },
    {
      "key": "gift_advice_followup.disliked",
      "text": "You came back? Fair. My next guess is {alternative_gift}.",
      "dispositions": [
        "rude",
        "hostile"
      ],
      "weight": 20
    }
  ],
  "openings": [
    {
      "id": "unemployed_opening",
      "text": "Mind the job site I have not found yet. What do you need?"
    }
  ],
  "closings": [
    {
      "id": "unemployed_closing",
      "text": "Back to looking useful before anyone notices, then."
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "unemployed_chat_work",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "Finding the right work is harder when everyone asks if you found it yet.",
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_question_general",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Work is work. Finding the right work is the tricky part.",
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_story_chance",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "A fair chance can look a lot like standing around until the right bell rings.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_greeting_site",
      "type": "greeting",
      "text": "If you see a spare job site, do mention it kindly.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_chat_waiting",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "Waiting for work is still work if you look worried enough.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_question_place",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Where do I fit? Somewhere useful, I hope, preferably before supper.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_story_bell",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "I once followed the bell hoping it meant opportunity. It meant hurry.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_joke_flexible",
      "type": "joke",
      "text": "Unemployed jokes are flexible. That is what I keep telling myself.",
      "weight": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_insult_idle",
      "type": "insult",
      "text": "That was idle talk, and I would know.",
      "weight": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_chat_errands",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "People with trades get tasks. People without trades get errands.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_question_chance",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "A fair chance is easier to ask for than to recognize.",
      "weight": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_story_barrel",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "I organized a barrel once. For a moment, everyone thought I had a calling.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_cautious_useful",
      "type": "chat",
      "text": "I am trying to look useful, not involved.",
      "dispositions": [
        "cautious",
        "fearful"
      ],
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_cured_recognition_warm_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember having no trade, no thoughts, almost no self. You helped with the important one.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "friendly",
        "respectful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_cured_recognition_warm_2",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I did not know what I would become, but you made sure I could become anything.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "friendly",
        "respectful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_cured_recognition_confused_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "Your face is familiar. So is being confused, but this feels different.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "neutral",
        "cautious"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_cured_recognition_confused_2",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember waking with empty hands and a head full of broken bells.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "neutral",
        "cautious"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_cured_recognition_uneasy_1",
      "type": "cured_recognition",
      "text": "I remember you, though I still do not know what to do with the memory.",
      "weight": 30,
      "dispositions": [
        "rude",
        "hostile",
        "fearful"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_thunderstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The open hands and odd jobs took the thunder badly, but everyone near my station is breathing.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_thunderstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the open hands and odd jobs first, then the people. Both needed steady hands.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_thunderstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "That storm rattled the open hands and odd jobs; it rattled us more.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_thunderstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Lightning makes every trade feel small. We are safe enough for now.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_thunderstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "thunderstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I will trust the sky again when it stops threatening the roof.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_fire_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the open hands and odd jobs for sparks. Then I checked faces for fear.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_fire_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "Smoke gets into everything: lungs, clothes, and the way people talk afterward.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_fire_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "The open hands and odd jobs can be replaced. People cannot. That is the count that matters.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_fire_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "We saved what hands could reach before the flames decided otherwise.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_fire_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "village_fire"
      ],
      "text": "Fire teaches quick priorities. Water, exits, children, neighbors.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_raid_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "During a raid, the open hands and odd jobs matters less than who makes it behind a door.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_raid_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "The horns stopped, but my hands still expect more trouble.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_raid_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "We counted survivors before supplies. That is the right order.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_raid_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "Raiders came looking for weakness. They found a village that remembers how to stand.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_raid_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "raid",
        "player_defended_raid"
      ],
      "text": "I saw fear move through the village and courage move faster.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_night_attack_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "Night trouble always finds the loose latch first. We are fixing those now.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_night_attack_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "I kept near the open hands and odd jobs and listened for anyone calling for help.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_night_attack_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "Dawn did not erase the attack, but it gave us light to count by.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_night_attack_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "The dark tested everyone. Most of us passed by staying alive.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_night_attack_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "night_attack"
      ],
      "text": "We are safe enough, though every shadow is getting inspected twice.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_sandstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The open hands and odd jobs collected half the desert, but the people made it indoors.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_sandstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "I checked the open hands and odd jobs, then checked who was coughing from the dust.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_sandstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Sand in the hinges, sand in the eyes, but no one missing so far.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_sandstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Harsh wind teaches you which doors really close.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_sandstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "sandstorm"
      ],
      "text": "We are safe enough, though the village sounds like it is grinding its teeth.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_snowstorm_1",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The open hands and odd jobs can wait. Warm hands and clear paths matter first.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_snowstorm_2",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Snow piled against the doors, but everyone near me found shelter.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_snowstorm_3",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "Cold works quietly. We are checking on anyone who went quiet too long.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_snowstorm_4",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "The open hands and odd jobs froze stiff, but the village kept moving.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_village_event_snowstorm_5",
      "type": "village_event_report",
      "event_tags": [
        "snowstorm"
      ],
      "text": "We are alright for now. Keep the fires fed and the paths open.",
      "weight": 34,
      "show_for_babies": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_share_story_1",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "{target_article}. I may not have a trade, but I know a warning when I hear one.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_share_story_2",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "I will tell people about {target}. Passing along danger is useful work.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_share_story_3",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "Some places make a person choose a different road. {target_article} sounds convincing.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_share_story_4",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "You brought back news from {target}. That gives the rest of us a chance to be sensible.",
      "weight": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_share_story_5",
      "type": "share_story",
      "option": "adult_share_story",
      "text": "I have time to listen, and this is worth hearing. {target_article} will not stay just your story.",
      "weight": 24
    }
  ],
  "pacify": [
    {
      "id": "unemployed_pacify_success",
      "outcomes": [
        "success"
      ],
      "text": "Fine. I have enough problems without carrying this one too.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_pacify_short",
      "outcomes": [
        "not_enough_emeralds"
      ],
      "text": "Even without a trade, I know that should be {emerald_cost} {emeralds}.",
      "weight": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "unemployed_pacify_blocked",
      "outcomes": [
        "blocked_by_reputation"
      ],
      "text": "No. I may not have work, but I still have sense.",
      "weight": 26
    }
  ]
}
